From 5986393ee83f465c47e954351ebc5dc947eb6ad4 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Codex <codex@localhost>
Date: Tue, 24 Nov 2026 05:14:13 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] d3d12: mirror API-written descriptors from live Vulkan heap
 mappings

Recognize the exact mapped arena allocation at heap creation. Copy a descriptor range to writable title memory while the heap registration is live, bounded by its declared size and stride. Retain the memory query for other backends.

The regression writes one CBV and copies another via the device proxy. Raw CPU copies of those slots are consumed on consecutive GPU submissions. It also exercises read-only backing and the disabled mirror.
